ass=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks! It's really interesting information, isn't it? What was especially provocative was how it can be applied at work.   <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes! Who you really need to apply it to is your boss! You are going to use some of the EI strategies to improve your relationship with her, aren't you?", "id": 1}, {"time": "24500", "image": "engenn9le04ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, for sure! I can't wait to try and implement some of what I learned about EI. I think if I can understand my boss and her emotions better, I'll be better able to gauge her behavior and where it's coming from. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's the key, isn't it? When she is acting aggressively or being overly critical, you'll know how to effectively interact with her. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, and I'll understand my own reactions to her. That I've been confused by her behavior isn't really surprising. I haven't looked for the reasons behind her conduct. That's been my problem, hasn't it?", "id": 2}, {"time": "57500", "image": "engenn9le04ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I think that if you can recognize that her behavior toward you is not personal, then you won't be so negatively affected by it. Who you should focus on changing a bit is you. Work on being more cognizant of other people's emotions and reactions, and you will feel more confident with your boss.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It sounds so easy, doesn't it?", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}